 "origem": "gringa: Japão (japonês): nishikigoi criadas em Niigata desde o início do séc. XIX; filtro biológico (amônia -> nitrito -> nitrato) https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Koi",
 "titulo": "You built a koi pond 🐟 #engineering #shorts",
 "capa": "YOU BUILT A KOI POND",
 "descripcion": "Leaks, green water, ammonia and filters: how a hole in the yard becomes a clear koi pond like the ones in Japan, one problem at a time.\n\nWhat should we build next?\n\n#engineering #koi #pond #japan #shorts",
